--- !u!114 &1068291368
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1068291367}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aef300d746ba31642a9b5d8dd7c94412, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - In Nick L.'s small bedroom...
  - 'Nick L.: ...Another quiet shift.'
  - '*phone ringing*'
  - "Penny: Nick! It's Penny from the D.O.T.\u2014don't hang up!"
  - 'Nick L.: That makes me want to hang up more. What''s your deal?'
  - 'Penny: Montefiore Square Park is falling apart. The city doesn''t have the budget
    to fix it.'
  - 'Nick L.: So they''re ignoring it. Sounds normal.'
  - "Penny: Not this time. The mayor wants it fixed\u2014but we need to raise the
    funding first."
  - 'Nick L.: And where do I come in?'
  - "Penny: Public engagement. Cleaner streets, visible impact\u2014every good action
    brings in funding and support."
  - 'Nick L.: So... I drive, people like it, money rolls in?'
  - 'Penny: That''s the idea.'
  - 'Nick L.: That''s a lot of pressure for a steering wheel.'
  - 'Penny: You''re one of our most reliable drivers. We need results today.'
  - 'Nick L.: Alright, fine.'
  - 'Penny: Get to the office. I''ll guide you in.'
  - '*click*'
  - 'Nick L.: *sigh*'
  - 'Nick L.: Fix a park by driving around... Yeah, this''ll be a day.'
  - 
  leftSprites:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7ba5d31f7359bdc44ac4df564541b52f, type: 3}
